pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Deceased\" title=\"Category:Deceased\">Deceased</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Student</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cause_of_death\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cause of Death</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Beheaded by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype mother</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #1</a> <i><small>(mentioned)</small></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #1</a> '<i><small>(mentioned)</small></i></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">But <i>Robbie</i> never did <i>shit</i> to you! He never even called you a goddamn name.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—<a href=\"/wiki/Dan_Brisby\" title=\"Dan Brisby\">Dan Brisby</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #1</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Robbie</b> is a young boy who attended <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak High School (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX0hpZ2hfU2Nob29sP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak High School</span>. He was a victim of the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Oscuratype Mother</span> in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Little is known about Robbie, other than he was friendly with both <a href=\"/wiki/Dan_Brisby\" title=\"Dan Brisby\">Dan Brisby</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a>. Dan remarks that Robbie was never cruel to James. Dan accuses James of killing Robbie for not liking him back romantically.\n</p><p>Robbie died during the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span>, with his head being found detached from his body. While for a while his cause of killer was unknown, it was later discovered to be an attack from an <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratype</a> <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Mother</span>. A memorial for him was placed outside <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak High School (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX0hpZ2hfU2Nob29sP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak High School</span> along with ones for <a href=\"/wiki/Tyler_Monitz\" title=\"Tyler Monitz\">Tyler Monitz</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Noah\" title=\"Noah\">Noah</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Karl\" title=\"Karl\">Karl</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\">Issue #1</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC1-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC1_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Angel_of_Archer%27s_Peak_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The Angel of Archer&#39;s Peak (comic arc)\">vol. #1</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\">issue no. 1</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2019.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div></small></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:43:10+00:00"}